1129:
The City hereby agrees to abide by the bylaws and the rules and regulations of the Board of Trustees of GMEBS in all matters pertaining to the operation and administration of the Contract. It is intended that the Act creating the Board of Trustees of GMEBS, the rules and regulations of the Board, the bylaws of the Board, and this Contract are to be construed in harmony with each other. But in the event of a conflict in the provisions of any of the foregoing, they shall govern in the following order:
(a) The Act creating the Board of Trustees of the Georgia Municipal Employees' Benefit System, Georgia Laws 1965, page 421, as amended by Georgia Laws 1966, page 539, Georgia Laws 1968, page 1387, Georgia Laws 1970, page 201, and Georgia Laws 1971, page 210, or as hereafter amended;
(b) The rules and regulations of the Board;
(c) The bylaws of the Board;
(d) This Ordinance and Contract.
